OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 23 FEB
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GKatie Derham presents live music
OL,6,     Gfrom singers Beverley Knight and
OL,7,     GNtombizodwa Ndlovu, with
OL,8,     Gguitarist Shirley Tetteh, plus
OL,9,     Gviolinist Pekka Kuusisto and folk
OL,10,     Gmusician Sam Amidon.
OL,11,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,12,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,13,     Gsoundscape including music by
OL,14,     GEvelyn Glennie, Grieg, Corelli,
OL,15,     GMilhaud, William Grant Smith and
OL,16,     GLili Boulanger.
OL,17,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,18,     GVasily Petrenko conducts the
OL,19,     GRoyal Philharmonic Orchestra at
OL,20,     Gthe Glasshouse in Gateshead in
OL,21,     GTchaikovsky's Piano Concerto No.1
OL,22,     Gand Shostakovich's Symphony No.10.
